},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "068119c6",
"en_raw": "...Yes, I made a bet"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "05494ed6",
"en_raw": "Rotten, right?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "ec48d8c2",
"en_raw": "That is rotten..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "6eed80f8",
"en_raw": "But we don't know"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "d4319c0c",
"en_raw": "I only heard this"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "77695a9b",
"en_raw": "from Yuasa and the others"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "4f45afee",
"en_raw": "Hey, Nao, that info is dodgy"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "a30163da",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "e3bc4a3a",
"en_raw": "As information, I"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "918cb2ef",
"en_raw": "think it's suspicious too"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "739aa651",
"en_raw": "We shouldn't stick our necks in"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "6ec739d4",
